  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> and <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> be two unit vectors such that <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo></math> For some <math><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>R,</mi></math>&nbsp;let <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math> If <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> and the vector <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> is inclined at the same angle <math> <mi>α</mi> </math> to both <math> <mrow> <mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>a</mi> <mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo> </mover> </mrow> </math> and <math> <mrow> <mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>b</mi> <mo stretchy=\"true\">→</mo> </mover> </mrow> <mo>,</mo></math> then the value of <math> <mrow> <mn>8</mn><msup> <mrow> <mi>cos</mi></mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mi>α</mi></mrow> </math> is",
